    "work_id": "scripture/web/phlm",
    "canonical_ref": "Phlm.1.3",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "Grace to you and peace from God our Father and the Lord Jesus Christ.",
    "chunk_index": 2,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 62,
    "date_range": [
      60,
      63
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "scripture/web/phlm#Phlm.1.4",
    "work_id": "scripture/web/phlm",
    "canonical_ref": "Phlm.1.4",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "I thank my God always, making mention of you in my prayers,",
    "chunk_index": 3,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 62,
    "date_range": [
      60,
      63
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "scripture/web/phlm#Phlm.1.5",
    "work_id": "scripture/web/phlm",
    "canonical_ref": "Phlm.1.5",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "hearing of your love and of the faith which you have toward the Lord Jesus and toward all the saints,",
    "chunk_index": 4,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 62,
    "date_range": [
      60,
      63
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "scripture/web/phlm#Phlm.1.6",
    "work_id": "scripture/web/phlm",
    "canonical_ref": "Phlm.1.6",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "that the fellowship of your faith may become effective in the knowledge of every good thing which is in us in Christ Jesus.",
    "chunk_index": 5,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 62,
    "date_range": [
      60,
      63
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "scripture/web/phlm#Phlm.1.7",
    "work_id": "scripture/web/phlm",
    "canonical_ref": "Phlm.1.7",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "For we have much joy and comfort in your love, because the hearts of the saints have been refreshed through you, brother.",
    "chunk_index": 6,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 62,
    "date_range": [
      60,
      63
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "scripture/web/phlm#Phlm.1.8",
    "work_id": "scripture/web/phlm",
    "canonical_ref": "Phlm.1.8",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "Therefore though I have all boldness in Christ to command you that which is appropriate,",
    "chunk_index": 7,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 62,
    "date_range": [
      60,
      63
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "scripture/web/phlm#Phlm.1.9",
    "work_id": "scripture/web/phlm",
    "canonical_ref": "Phlm.1.9",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "yet for love’s sake I rather appeal to you, being such a one as Paul, the aged, but also a prisoner of Jesus Christ.",
    "chunk_index": 8,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 62,
    "date_range": [
      60,
      63
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "scripture/web/phlm#Phlm.1.10",
    "work_id": "scripture/web/phlm",
    "canonical_ref": "Phlm.1.10",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "I appeal to you for my child Onesimus, whom I have become the father of in my chains,",
    "chunk_index": 9,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 62,
    "date_range": [
      60,
      63
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "scripture/web/phlm#Phlm.1.11",
    "work_id": "scripture/web/phlm",
    "canonical_ref": "Phlm.1.11",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "who once was useless to you, but now is useful to you and to me.",
    "chunk_index": 10,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 62,
    "date_range": [
      60,
      63
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "scripture/web/phlm#Phlm.1.12",
    "work_id": "scripture/web/phlm",
    "canonical_ref": "Phlm.1.12",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "I am sending him back. Therefore receive him, that is, my own heart,",
    "chunk_index": 11,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 62,
    "date_range": [
      60,
      63
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "scripture/web/phlm#Phlm.1.13",
    "work_id": "scripture/web/phlm",
    "canonical_ref": "Phlm.1.13",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "whom I desired to keep with me, that on your behalf he might serve me in my chains for the Good News.",
    "chunk_index": 12,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 62,
    "date_range": [
      60,
      63
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "scripture/web/phlm#Phlm.1.14",
    "work_id": "scripture/web/phlm",
    "canonical_ref": "Phlm.1.14",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "But I was willing to do nothing without your consent, that your goodness would not be as of necessity, but of free will.",
    "chunk_index": 13,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 62,
    "date_range": [
      60,
      63
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "scripture/web/phlm#Phlm.1.15",
    "work_id": "scripture/web/phlm",
    "canonical_ref": "Phlm.1.15",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "For perhaps he was therefore separated from you for a while that you would have him forever,",
    "chunk_index": 14,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 62,
    "date_range": [
      60,
      63
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "scripture/web/phlm#Phlm.1.16",
    "work_id": "scripture/web/phlm",
    "canonical_ref": "Phlm.1.16",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "no longer as a slave, but more than a slave, a beloved brother—especially to me, but how much rather to you, both in the flesh and in the Lord.",
    "chunk_index": 15,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 62,
    "date_range": [
      60,
      63
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "scripture/web/phlm#Phlm.1.17",
    "work_id": "scripture/web/phlm",
    "canonical_ref": "Phlm.1.17",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "If then you count me a partner, receive him as you would receive me.",
    "chunk_index": 16,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 62,
    "date_range": [
      60,
      63
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "scripture/web/phlm#Phlm.1.18",
    "work_id": "scripture/web/phlm",
    "canonical_ref": "Phlm.1.18",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "But if he has wronged you at all or owes you anything, put that to my account.",
    "chunk_index": 17,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 62,
    "date_range": [
      60,
      63
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "scripture/web/phlm#Phlm.1.19",
    "work_id": "scripture/web/phlm",
    "canonical_ref": "Phlm.1.19",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "I, Paul, write this with my own hand: I will repay it (not to mention to you that you owe to me even your own self besides).",
    "chunk_index": 18,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 62,
    "date_range": [
      60,
      63
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "scripture/web/phlm#Phlm.1.20",
    "work_id": "scripture/web/phlm",
    "canonical_ref": "Phlm.1.20",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "Yes, brother, let me have joy from you in the Lord. Refresh my heart in the Lord.",
    "chunk_index": 19,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 62,
    "date_range": [
      60,
      63
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "scripture/web/phlm#Phlm.1.21",
    "work_id": "scripture/web/phlm",
    "canonical_ref": "Phlm.1.21",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "Having confidence in your obedience, I write to you, knowing that you will do even beyond what I say.",
    "chunk_index": 20,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 62,
    "date_range": [
      60,
      63
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "scripture/web/phlm#Phlm.1.22",
    "work_id": "scripture/web/phlm",
    "canonical_ref": "Phlm.1.22",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "Also, prepare a guest room for me, for I hope that through your prayers I will be restored to you.",
    "chunk_index": 21,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 62,
    "date_range": [
      60,
      63
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "scripture/web/phlm#Phlm.1.23",
    "work_id": "scripture/web/phlm",
    "canonical_ref": "Phlm.1.23",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "Epaphras, my fellow prisoner in Christ Jesus, greets you,",
    "chunk_index": 22,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 62,
    "date_range": [
      60,
      63
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
